  "title": "Kale Salad with Cranberries",
  "description": "This refreshing salad is a combination of kale, red onions, feta cheese, and toasted walnuts--all marinated in a tart and sweet cranberry balsamic vinaigrette.",
  "authors": [
    "Rita M Frantz"
  ],
